Changes: streaming container parsing and explicit validation, NumPy/MLX
weight preparation instead of native binaries, an explicit lossless converter,
standard model configuration, model-local fp32 preprocessing, and a model
subclass instead of runtime method replacement. TDT decoding uses the existing
MLX Audio Parakeet implementation.

Model weights are not included in this package. Phonon-2 weights derive from
nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 (Copyright NVIDIA Corporation) and are CC-BY-4.0.
